<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Deepdub QC — operator slots in use</title>
<link rel="preload" href="/static/fonts/onest-latin-wght-normal.woff2"
      as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/app.css"></head>
<body>
<main class="centered-panel">
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="wordmark"><img src="/static/wordmark.svg" alt="Deepdub"
      width="106" height="24"><span class="qc-tag" aria-hidden="true">QC</span></div>
    <h1>Both operator slots are in use</h1>
    <p>The QC console allows {{ max_sessions }} concurrent operators.
       A slot frees after {{ ttl_minutes }} minutes of inactivity.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/">Retry</a>
  </div>
</main>
<footer class="shell-footer mono">deepdub-qc v{{ version }}</footer>
</body>
</html>
